title: "SecurePoL-with-Watermarking"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of SecurePoL: Proof-of-Learning training logs
  combined with three model watermarking strategies (feature-based triggers,
  sparse parameter perturbation, and a non-intrusive auxiliary head), with a
  dual-layer verifier and a spoofing-attack harness. CIFAR-10, ResNet-20.
